      "content": "Here is a draft memo framework to address this sensitive issue. Start by reaffirming your company's commitment to a respectful and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of background. Clearly articulate that while you respect personal beliefs, the internal workplace communications channels are intended for business purposes. Finally, establish guidelines that require political commentary to remain respectful and avoid creating a hostile or disruptive environment for colleagues.",
